# The research corpus ships as CRLF-delimited CSV, the form the research and
# merge pipeline produces. Line endings are preserved deliberately, so exempt
# these files from whitespace checking: `git diff --check` counts each touched
# line's CR as trailing whitespace, which failed `pnpm run quality:hygiene` on
# every dataset edit even when the edit itself was clean.
src/data/*.csv -whitespace
data/**/*.csv -whitespace
